# Versification "UBH": the stored Ukrainian `ubh` against org.vrs.
# Bible-API correction file, checked 2026-11-02 against cep_public
# translation 20 (chapter lengths and verse texts). A book line replaces the
# book's chapter lengths; a mapping replaces the base mapping of its verse.
# A mapping onto a book outside the 66 (ESG, DAG, SUS, BEL) marks verses with
# no counterpart in them.
#
# Numbers 26:1 includes 25:19; Nehemiah 7 and Joel follow English numbering.
